CONTEXT Permits INCLUDES Registry FROM "../contexts/registry_with_towns.adl"
CONTEXT Permits IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Permits
{+ Permits includes Registry, which includes Towns. Permits does not include Towns.
The concept of towns is visible in Permits all the same: it is the target of `Registry.residence`,
and the type checker infers it as the target of the relation `stay`. +}

RELATION applicant[Permit*Registry.Person] [UNI,TOT]
POPULATION applicant[Permit*Registry.Person] CONTAINS [ ("permit1", "p1") ]

RULE hasResidence : applicant |- applicant;Registry.residence;Registry.residence~
ROLE Clerk MAINTAINS hasResidence

ENDCONTEXT
